---
title: "transferInvestorPosition (LegionPreLiquidApprovedSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_auth: transferInvestorPosition(from, to)
    q_check_auth --> q_check_refund: caller == legionOperator
    q_check_auth --> q_revert_auth: unauthorized
    q_check_refund --> q_check_to: block.timestamp > refundEndTime
    q_check_refund --> q_revert_refund: refund period not ended
    q_check_to --> q_check_existing: to != address(0) AND from != to
    q_check_to --> q_revert_params: invalid destination
    q_check_existing --> q_check_no_dest: investorPosition[from].investedCapital > 0
    q_check_existing --> q_revert_no_position: source has no position
    q_check_no_dest --> q_transfer_position: investorPosition[to].investedCapital == 0
    q_check_no_dest --> q_revert_dest_exists: destination already has position
    q_transfer_position --> q_clear_source: investorPosition[to] = investorPosition[from]
    q_clear_source --> q_emit: delete investorPosition[from]
    q_emit --> [*]: emit PositionTransferred(from, to)
    q_revert_auth --> [*]: revert Unauthorized
    q_revert_refund --> [*]: revert RefundPeriodNotEnded
    q_revert_params --> [*]: revert InvalidAddress
    q_revert_no_position --> [*]: revert NoPosition
    q_revert_dest_exists --> [*]: revert DestinationHasPosition

    note right of q_transfer_position
        INV-001: position transfer blocked during refund period
        INV-002: SAFT-cached terms (investAmount, tokenAllocationRate) transfer with position
        INV-003: vesting contract address transfers with position
        INV-004: destination must not have existing position
    end note
